Snake
=====

Guide the snake to the food with the arrow keys. Each piece of food
makes the snake one cell longer. Don't run into the edge of the board
or into yourself!

Click Select on the Snake icon on the icon bar to open the game's
window. Press Space to start again after a crash. Click Menu on the
icon or the window for Info, New game and Quit.

The best score so far is kept in the file HighScore inside the
application.

Snake is the example program in chapter 13 of the book "Programming
in JavaScript" (HardDisc4.$.Manuals.JSTutor).
